id: repair
name: Repair
type: standard
actionCost: 2
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
special: true
usageLimit: 1/encounter
repair: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Craft Skill Check at a Weapon's or a piece of Apparel's Craft DC: the Weapon gets back 2d10(bT)
  plus your Craft Skill Bonus in Life Points, the Apparel 2 Break Value.
text: >
  Repair Maneuver [1/Encounter]: Take a moment during battle to take care of your gear.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 2 Actions
  –Minions: N/A
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Exploitable: N/A
  –Effect: Make a Craft Skill Check against the Craft DC of a Weapon/piece of Apparel you possess OR a Vehicle/Battle Jacket you are adjacent to. If you succeed, depending on the chosen Item: restore the Life Points of the Weapon/Vehicle/Battle Jacket by 2d10(bT) plus your Skill Bonus for the relevant Craft Skill Specialization or regain 2 Break Value for that piece of Apparel.

---

# No script: it changes an Item, which a script cannot reach. `repair: true` hands it to the code
# (use-maneuver.mjs `askRepair`, chat.mjs `repairGear`). The Item is picked before anything is paid;
# the card names the Check and its Difficulty, the Check is rolled from the sheet as the Treatment
# Maneuver's is, and the card's button applies what it restores.
#
# The user's rulings: only an Item whose Craft Specialty the character has ticked (Weapons for a
# Weapon, Apparel for Apparel) - the others are shown refused, with the reason; and a broken one (0
# Life Points, 0 Break Value) is brought back by it.
#
# Not built: Vehicles and Battle Jackets, which are not in the system.
